<h2>Who it&rsquo;s for</h2>
<div class="grid">
  <div>
    <h3>Skaters</h3>
    <p>
      Your own record, including every note a coach has written against an
      element. Yours to read, and yours to delete.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>Coaches</h3>
    <p>
      Score a run-through, record a competition, and keep a season&rsquo;s
      worth of context on each skater you work with.
      A coach sees a skater&rsquo;s log only through a link the skater has accepted, can read it but never change it, and keeps their own scores and competitions.
      A skater can end the link whenever they like.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
